; @smkbacil/design-ui is a PRIVATE (access: restricted) npm package.
; Fresh installs (CI, a new machine, or a cleared pnpm store) need a token with
; READ access to the @smkbacil scope, supplied via the NPM_TOKEN environment
; variable. NEVER commit the token itself — only this ${NPM_TOKEN} reference.
;   PowerShell:  $env:NPM_TOKEN = "npm_xxx"   (then: pnpm install)
@smkbacil:registry=https://registry.npmjs.org/
//registry.npmjs.org/:_authToken=${NPM_TOKEN}
